<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-075" chapter-id="c-jinshu-075-yuanyuezhi" source-id="s-jinshu-075-yuanyuezhi-ws2645530">
  <p id="c-jinshu-075-yuanyuezhi:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-075-yuanyuezhi:p001:m0000" ref="c72_605_73c">袁悅之</persName>，字元禮，陳郡陽夏人也。父<persName id="c-jinshu-075-yuanyuezhi:p001:m0016" ref="9gp_kvn_8ib">朗</persName>，給事中。悅之能長短說，甚有精理。始為<persName id="c-jinshu-075-yuanyuezhi:p001:m0036" ref="aa6_83c_juy_CD">謝玄</persName>參軍，為玄所遇，丁憂去職。服闋還都，止齎《戰國策》，言天下要惟此書。後甚為會稽王<persName id="c-jinshu-075-yuanyuezhi:p001:m0078" ref="dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAAFA">道子</persName>所親愛，每勸道子專覽朝權，道子頗納其說。俄而見誅。</p>
</text>
